<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>The Blocksize parameter indicates, how many consecutive frames shall be sent in a transmission before a flow control frame is sent. The number 0 tells the sender, that no more flow controls should disrupt the sending of the remaining flow controls</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it'>The Blocksize parameter indicates, how many consecutive frames shall be sent in a transmission before a flow control frame is sent. The number 0 tells the sender, that no more flow controls should disrupt the sending of the remaining flow controls</TUV>
