<TUV xml:lang='it'>STmin</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>(Separation Time) defines the minimum time gap between consecutive frames.Values from 0x00 to 0x7F (0 – 127) are absolute milliseconds.Values from 0xF1 to 0xF9 are even 100 micro seconds.Every other value range is reserved and should not be used.</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it'>(Separation Time) defines the minimum time gap between consecutive frames.Values from 0x00 to 0x7F (0 – 127) are absolute milliseconds.Values from 0xF1 to 0xF9 are even 100 micro seconds.Every other value range is reserved and should not be used.</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>Diagnostic_CAN_0614_11_Bit.StMin</QUAL>
</UNSDEF>
