<HISTITEM authorref='_00000271828F1280' stid='0' tool='CANdelaStudio 12 Release Standard' dt='2022-07-01 17:08:19+05:30'>
<LABEL>0.24</LABEL>
<MOD>DID's: 
1. FD1D are not supported in programming session. Need to updated Cdd for this change.(Req changed after cdd update. req in Draft state) 
2. FD13 are not supported in programming session. Need to updated Cdd for this change.(Req changed after cdd update. req in Draft state)  
3. F184 and F185, Security level needs to be updated in cdd. only Authenticated diag access required 
4. 2013, NRC 21 have to be added for read service. NRC 14, 22 can be deleted.     
5. 5001, NRC 22, 33 addition for read service    
6. 5102,5103,5104,5105 NRC 21 have to be added and NRC 14, 22 can be deleted. 


RID's: 
1. Doo2 NRC 7f needs to be added.
2. Ff00 NRC 24 needs to be added. 
3. ff01 security  needs to be added. 
4. D003 session needs to be updated to programing only. security cfg needs to be updated.  ----&#62;Done
5. 2001 security cfg needs to be updated. NRC 22 is extra 


DTC's Enable Condition Modification </MOD>
<REASON></REASON>
</HISTITEM>
