<TEXTTBL id='_00000271848A13C0' oid='2977B1CB83EC4226806615E07428B241' bm='255'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Wheel Direction (1Byte)_20508</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</NAME>
<QUAL>Wheel_Direction_1Byte_20508</QUAL>
<CVALUETYPE bl='8' bo='21' enc='uns' sig='0' df='hex' qty='atom' sz='no' minsz='1' maxsz='1'/>
<PVALUETYPE bl='16' bo='21' enc='utf' sig='0' df='text' qty='field' sz='no' minsz='0' maxsz='65535'/>
<TEXTMAP s='1' e='1'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>WAIT_ENGINE SPM can't operate. Engine is not running</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='2' e='2'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>IDLE SPM ready to start. Engine is running and no faults are present</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='3' e='3'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>SEEK ACTIVE SPS button pressed. Engine is running and vehicle is moving forward (vehicle speed &#60; 27 kmph)</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='4' e='4'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>SEEK IDLE Parking slot detection stopped. Vehicle is moving backward</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='5' e='5'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>EPS_COM_REQ SPM sends to the EPS the request of Torque</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='6' e='6'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>EPS_READY EPS is ready to start the steering movement. Vehicle in stand still condition</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='7' e='7'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>SA_ACTIVE SPS is performing the steering wheel control. Vehicle is moving (backward or forward)</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='8' e='8'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>AUTOMATIC_SYS_OFF SPM deactivated due to functional reason that doesn't allow the SPM to complete</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='9' e='9'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>SPS_RecoverableFault Recoverable Fault detected (DTC stored). SPM will not operate until the fault is present</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='10' e='10'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>SPS_FAULT Unrecoverable Fault detected (DTC stored). SPM can't operate until the fault is present and a key off key on cycle is performed</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
</TEXTTBL>
<TEXTTBL id='_000002718489F0C0' oid='911C5A84BD0B4f34B06C638637CE2BA3' bm='255'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>HMI code_20510</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</NAME>
<QUAL>HMI_code_20510</QUAL>
<CVALUETYPE bl='8' bo='21' enc='uns' sig='0' df='hex' qty='atom' sz='no' minsz='1' maxsz='1'/>
<PVALUETYPE bl='16' bo='21' enc='utf' sig='0' df='text' qty='field' sz='no' minsz='0' maxsz='65535'/>
<TEXTMAP s='0' e='0'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>No indication; Buzzer OFF; Led OFF No information related to SPS</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='1' e='1'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Deactivate Reverse Gear;Buzzer ON; Led ON Before to activate the SPS, it is necessary to deactivate the reverse gear</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='2' e='2'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Seeking (Right side); Buzzer OFF; Led ON The SPS is active and it is seeking a parking slot on the right side of the street</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='3' e='3'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Seeking (Left side); Buzzer OFF; Led ON The SPS is active and it is seeking a parking slot on the left side of the street</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='4' e='4'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Park slot in 1 manoeuvre (Right Side); Buzzer ON; Led ON The SPS has found a parking slot on the right that allows to park in one manoeuvre</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='5' e='5'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Park slot in 1 manoeuvre (Left Side); Buzzer ON; Led ON The SPS has found a parking slot on the left that allows to park in one manoeuvre</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='6' e='6'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Park slot in more than 1 manoeuvre (Right Side); Buzzer ON; Led ON The SPS has found a parking slot on the right that allows to park in more than one manoeuvre</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='7' e='7'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Park slot in more than 1 manoeuvre(Left Side); Buzzer ON; Led ON The SPS has found a parking slot on the left that allows to park in more than one manoeuvre</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='8' e='8'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Go Forward (Right side); Buzzer Off; Led ON The vehicle stopped too early on the right. To adjust the position the user need to move forward</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='9' e='9'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Go Forward (Left side); Buzzer Off; Led ON The vehicle stopped too early on the left. To adjust the position the user need to move forward</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='10' e='10'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Insert Reverse Gear (Right Side); Buzzer Off; Led ON The slot on the right is Ok. To start the manoeuvre insert the reverse gear</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='11' e='11'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Insert Reverse Gear (Right Side); Buzzer ON; Led ON The slot on the right is Ok. To start the manoeuvre insert the reverse gear</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='12' e='12'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Insert Reverse Gear (Left Side); Buzzer Off; Led ON The slot on the left is Ok. To start the manoeuvre insert the reverse gear</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='13' e='13'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Insert Reverse Gear (Left Side); Buzzer ON; Led ON The slot on the left is Ok. To start the manoeuvre insert the reverse gear</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='14' e='14'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Hands on Steering Wheel Before Start; Buzzer Off; Led ON Before starting the manoeuvre, take the hands off of the steering wheel</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='15' e='15'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Speed too High; Buzzer ON; Led ON The vehicle speed is too high</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='17' e='17'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Try Later; Buzzer ON; Led ON Temporary fault. Wait few minutes</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='18' e='18'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Hands on Steering Wheel and Ready to Strat; Buzzer ON; Led ON Before starting the manoeuvre, take the hands off of the steering wheel The system is ready to start</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='19' e='19'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Steering Wheel touched; Buzzer ON; Led ON The steering wheel has been touched</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='20' e='20'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Disinsertion; Buzzer Off; Led ON The SPS is shutting down</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='21' e='21'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>End Going Forward (Right Side); Buzzer Off; Led ON The backward movement is ended and the driver is asked to start the forward movement</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='22' e='22'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>End Manually; Buzzer Off; Led ON The SPS is shutting down, the manoeuvre has to be completed manually</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='23' e='23'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Tralier Presence; Buzzer Off; Led ON The vehicle has a back-hitch and the SPS can not switch on</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='24' e='24'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>End Going Forward (Left Side); Buzzer Off; Led ON The backward movement is ended and the driver is asked to start the forward movement</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='25' e='25'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Parking Aid Activated; Buzzer Off; Led ON During the seek phase was pushed the UPA button but the UPA can not be activated</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='26' e='26'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>End Going Backward (Right Side); Buzzer Off; Led ON The forward movement is ended and the driver is asked to start the backward movement</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='27' e='27'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>End Going Backward (Left Side); Buzzer Off; Led ON The forward movement is ended and the driver is asked to start the backward movement</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='28' e='28'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Insert Reverse Gear for Completing (Right Side); Buzzer Off; Led ON The driver is asked to engage the reverse gear again</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='29' e='29'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Insert Reverse Gear for Completing (Left Side); Buzzer Off; Led ON The driver is asked to engage the reverse gear again</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
</TEXTTBL>
<TEXTTBL id='_000002718489F200' oid='4A1BB1B9E2044bf393D4A16926FA3479' bm='255'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>SPS_AbortCondition</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</NAME>
<QUAL>SPS_AbortCondition</QUAL>
<CVALUETYPE bl='8' bo='21' enc='uns' sig='0' df='hex' qty='atom' sz='no' minsz='1' maxsz='1'/>
<PVALUETYPE bl='16' bo='21' enc='utf' sig='0' df='text' qty='field' sz='no' minsz='0' maxsz='65535'/>
<TEXTMAP s='0' e='0'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>No abort</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='16' e='16'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>ABS/ESC active</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='17' e='17'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Trailer detected</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='18' e='18'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Speed too high</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='19' e='19'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>PPPA button pressed</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='20' e='20'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Timeout during seeking</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='21' e='21'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Steering Torque Interface timeout</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='22' e='22'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Timeout during guidance</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='23' e='23'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Hands on steering wheel detected</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='24' e='24'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Park assist button pressed</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='25' e='25'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Recoverable fault detected - Invalid data or LOC with another ECU. Details in fault memory.</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='26' e='26'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Recoverable fault detected - Invalid data or LOC with another ECU. Details in fault memory.</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='27' e='27'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Door Open</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='28' e='28'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Liftgate Open</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='29' e='29'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>4WD Low Active</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='30' e='30'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Front sensor blockage</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='31' e='31'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Rear sensor blockage</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='32' e='32'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Cruise Control engaged</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='33' e='33'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>APG abort due to internal error</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='34' e='34'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>APG abort due to wrong input data</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='35' e='35'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>APG abort because the supported maximum number of moves is reached</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='36' e='36'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>APG abort because was deactivated via a controlled shutdown</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='37' e='37'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>APG abort because if in STANDBY mode but reactivation is not possible any more</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='38' e='38'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>APG abort because no valid path can be found into parking space from current position</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='39' e='39'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>APG abort because specified travel distance of uncontrolled vehicle movement reached</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='40' e='40'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>APG abort because an obstacle is on the path but a move in the other direction is not possible</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='41' e='41'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>APG abort because there is a (permanent) full warning in both directions</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='42' e='42'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>APG abort because parking space becomes too small for the maneuver. Usually in Parallel Park Exit if a full warning on both sides occurs (the walls are "closing in" or the parking space was too small to begin with)</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='43' e='43'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>APG abort  due to large deviation between ideal path</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='44' e='44'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>APG abort due to large SWA deviation</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='45' e='45'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>APG abort because outside of suboptimal target position range</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='46' e='46'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>APG abort because maximum yaw angle change allowed in the maneuver is exceeded. Usually a parallel park exit abort condition.</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='47' e='47'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>APG abort because the OLO extension has exceeded the parameterized maximum</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='48' e='48'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>APG abort because parking slot side or type does not match current manuever</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='49' e='49'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>APG abort because falsely incremented move count number</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='50' e='50'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>APG abort because too much or too fast steering into opposite direction</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='51' e='51'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>APG abort because SWA, kappa, sign, error</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</TEXT>
</TEXTMAP>
<TEXTMAP s='52' e='52'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>APG abort because requested steering is above spec limits</TUV>
