</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>(ASR DEM) Supported: Aging/ unlearning of the event is supported
Not Supported: Aging/ unlearning of the event is not supported</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>DTC_AGING_SUPPORTED</QUAL>
<ETAG v='0'>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>supported</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</ETAG>
<ETAG v='1'>
