<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>(ASR DEM) Defines the Step size for incrementation (PREFAILED). Range: 0 - 127</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it' uptodate='0'></TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>DTC_STEP_SIZE_PREFAILED</QUAL>
