<TUV xml:lang='it'>Vehicle Info</TUV>
</NAME>
<QUAL>Vehicle_Info</QUAL>
<SHORTCUTNAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Calibration Verification Numbers Vehicle Info</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it'>Calibration Verification Numbers Vehicle Info</TUV>
</SHORTCUTNAME>
<SHORTCUTQUAL>Calibration_Verification_Numbers_Vehicle_Info</SHORTCUTQUAL>
</SERVICE>
<STATICVALUE oid='2D80BFA08E764f83A543A7F2D72E966B' temploid='4154CAA360DB4f88A21868DA195C7709' shstaticref='_0000027186177F50' v='6'/>
<SIMPLECOMPCONT oid='6F7D3D731CF942d292F46AC6C53FBF91' temploid='01A51D1CF9154b4b93609774B91D4C83' shproxyref='_00000271860B9220'>
<DATAOBJ oid='B6C76BCC71E343edB0AE6F83B3A51C28' temploid='500B086766684f28B16517644830527E' spec='no' v='1' dtref='_0000027182C4A5B0'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>NumberOfDataItems</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it'>NumberOfDataItems</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>This parameter defines the number of data items included in the response message which are identified and
belong to the InfoType reported. For example, a request message with the InfoType for CVN (Calibration
Verification Number) may cause the ECU to send a response message, that contains multiple CVNs. The amount
of CVNs is included in the “Number of data items” parameter</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it'>Questo parametro definisce il numero di data item inclusi nel messaggio di risposta che appartengono all'InfoType riportato. Per esempio, un messaggio di richiesta
con InfoType per il CVN (Calibration Verification Number) può causare un messaggio di risposta della centralina contenente più CVN. La quantità di CVNs è inclusa 
nel parametro "Number of data items".</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>NumberOfDataItems</QUAL>
</DATAOBJ>
<DATAOBJ oid='737C627AE03E4659855A5CE3D22ECFAE' temploid='37CE81ECA2CF4259B76E47355438C89F' spec='no' dtref='_00000271F0F79630'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Calibration Verification Numbers</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='it'>Calibration Verification Numbers</TUV>
</NAME>
<QUAL>Calibration_Verification_Numbers</QUAL>
</DATAOBJ>
</SIMPLECOMPCONT>
